Werecreatures are people who can take an animal's shape. In their own body they keep something of the animal about them, enough that a careful eye can pick it out. In a fight they change into boars, rats, tigers, crocodiles and other beasts, and they fight with tusks, teeth and claws.

A wound from one carries a curse. A person strong enough can shake it off, and those it takes become the same kind of creature. The [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]] are werecreatures.
